{"unit_id":"Bing-Bryan__dsh-unread-dot#card-zh","repo":"Bing-Bryan/dsh-unread-dot","commit":"c6dbc1dae83928f10f4f713f5fcfc7423babefd9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unread-dot 是面向 DSH Web 的会话提醒插件：当应用窗口隐藏、失焦或最小化时，它通过浏览器 Badging API 在 Dock 图标显示未读角标。插件订阅会话列表，区分正在运行、已经完成和等待用户处理的会话；运行期间可显示无数字活动点，完成或等待处理的未读会话显示数字。窗口重新获得焦点后，当前提醒会标记为已读并清除角标。完成或需要处理时还可播放内嵌的水泡提示音，并提供角标、活动点和声音开关及测试按钮。适合希望离开 DSH Web 窗口时仍能留意会话进度的用户；不需要额外账号或 API 密钥，角标依赖支持 Badging API 的浏览器环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:9","lib/client.js:190-210","lib/client.js:249-290","lib/client.js:311-323"]}
{"unit_id":"Bing-Bryan__dsh-unread-dot#card-en","repo":"Bing-Bryan/dsh-unread-dot","commit":"c6dbc1dae83928f10f4f713f5fcfc7423babefd9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-unread-dot alerts DSH Web users to session activity. It shows Dock badges for unread completed or waiting sessions, an activity dot for running work, and clears alerts when the window regains focus. Settings control badges and chime. No API key is needed; Badging API support is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:9","lib/client.js:190-210","lib/client.js:249-290","lib/client.js:311-323"]}
